## Deferred decisions and finish boundary
Machine schema, storage, command surface, target environment verification policy,
and integration with module seating remain to be designed after the checker review.
No new dependency resolver, module code, pack, execution, kernel edit or activation
is released by this page. AR-01 remains held; sealed captures stay unchanged.
This setup is complete when its notes, contract, menu and book navigation agree.
